ategory_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Soup","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"-1XSzguS6XLN-V6MVZMg2A","review_id":"4g68f5KvY14lkLvxQVjIeA","date":"2016-03-08T18:04:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9493287205696106,"text_excerpt":"On our recent trip home, I was looking forward to trying out this new \"hot spot\" that has been highly recommended among fellow Yelpers. We didn't want to deal with the hustle and bustle of the touristy crowds who only associate New Orleans with Emeril. Restaurant Rebirth has become a new favorite to come back to when we're in town. First off, location is convenient especially for convention goers. They're located on Fulton St. in the Warehouse District across from the Marriott hotel. The thing I really liked was that it was off on its own and away from the heavy crowds. Even if you were to drive here for dinner, parking was easy to find along this stretch of Fulton but make sure to feed t..."},{"business_id":"-1XSzguS6XLN-V6MVZMg2A","review_id":"GVbiafg9EXNtXnuO2wny9w","date":"2016-04-06T04:27:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9491350650787354,"text_excerpt":"Life changing. That's how I would describe our experience. This place is so good I would actually just fly to New Orleans for dinner to come here. Where to start. This food is like nothing I've had. Please start your meal with pork belly. Chef smokes it for like 16 hours, and then uses his homemade BBQ sauce. It was phenomenal. Of 5 of us, we got 4 different meals (two had the pork chop). I sampled everyone's. The pork chop was huge and perfectly cooked and so flavorful. The blackened scallops were to die for. So moist and cooked perfectly - served with fingerling potatoes and some sort of crawfish chowder. One of our friends ordered steak (which I don't ever do in New Orleans) and it was..."},{"business_id":"-1XSzguS6XLN-V6MVZMg2A","review_id":"Z3sjdCDDlaNPaGyS5mWc_w","date":"2017-03-29T14:00:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9472841024398804,"text_excerpt":"We hit a real gem by making a reservation here. I wasn't sure what to expect but Yelp really helped us out here. I was looking for Cajun Creole food for our one big dinner in town and Restaurant Rebirth hit that spot. We made reservations 5 days in advance and got a table for 5 without any issues. LOVED it. You'll find all the favorites here from pork belly to gumbo to steak. They have it all. I started off with the gumbo which was by far the best I have had. Everyone will have their favorites but this was my gumbo favorite. Served in a piping hot \"cauldron\" the gumbo was everything you'd want: hearty, warm, spicy, spiced! For my entree I had the Gulf Seafood al Ajillo: a mixture of all t..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"-1XSzguS6XLN-V6MVZMg2A","photo_id":"t_Mf2PYxuH4LPvvomYehxg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/t_Mf2PYxuH4LPvvomYehxg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9075268507003784},{"business_id":"-1XSzguS6XLN-V6MVZMg2A","photo_id":"utkDnVjISbvWUcw2FsowWQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/utkDnVjISbvWUcw2FsowWQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8471484184265137},{"business_id":"-1XSzguS6XLN-V6MVZMg2A","photo_id":"pz0UWigHjz9LX1PprZqiZA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/pz0UWigHjz9LX1PprZqiZA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8430565595626831},{"business_id":"-1XSzguS6XLN-V6MVZMg2A","photo_id":"v8WR1Di2w1qJ3Xw__5aEBw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/v8WR1Di2w1qJ3Xw__5aEBw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8420736789703369},{"business_id":"-1XSzguS6XLN-V6MVZMg2A","photo_id":"Y9fsG5EOJP4BxnvbDVDxGA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Y9fsG5EOJP4BxnvbDVDxGA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8197558522224426}]},"notebook_case":null}
